# ── Private TLS identity — NEVER commit here ──────────────────────────────────
# remoteclient_cert.pem / remoteclient_key.pem is a RemoteCA-signed identity
# extracted from Hisense's official app. It must NOT be published. This copy of
# the tester lives in a repo that may be public, so the keys are intentionally
# excluded. Place them next to hisense_tv_tester.py locally and the mock uses
# them automatically; without them it falls back to a self-signed cert (fine for
# your own app + the self-test, but the official RemoteNOW app needs the real one).
remoteclient_cert.pem
remoteclient_key.pem
*.p12
*.bks

# ── Auto-generated fallback certs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
mock_hisense_cert.pem
mock_hisense_key.pem

# ── Third-party binaries / decompile toolchain (never redistribute) ───────────
*.apk
*.ipa
*.xapk
*.dex
remotenow_extracted/
vidaa_extracted/
remotenow_decompiled/
jre/
jadx-tool/

# ── Scratch / captures / logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pcap
*.out
*.log

# ── Python / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.venv/
venv/
